It doesn’t run for commands that don’t need approval.</p>
<p><code>matcher</code> is applied to <code>tool_name</code> and matcher aliases. Current canonical
values include <code>Bash</code>, <code>apply_patch</code>, and MCP tool names such as
<code>mcp__server__tool</code>; <code>apply_patch</code> also matches <code>Edit</code> and <code>Write</code>.</p>
